text = "WASD move · Shift sprint · Ctrl walk · Space jump · C crouch
LMB attack (hold: heavy) · MMB heavy · RMB guard
Rifle: RMB aim · LMB fire · R reload
Space while guarding/aiming: dodge · F cover
1 fists · 2 melee · 3 rifle · wheel switch
E pick up / hold E search · G drop · H holster · Tab inventory
Q swap shoulder · F3 debug · F4 play clips
F5 restart fight · F6 next mode (district: in the gym)
Esc release mouse"

